WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:02.990
Regulars who haven't been back for a while?

00:00:03.016 --> 00:00:05.230
A new offer your customers don't know about yet?

00:00:05.578 --> 00:00:08.990
A beautiful email, sent to the right people, brings them back.

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:13.150
Let me show you how to send a promotional email, right inside VaraaAi.

00:00:13.773 --> 00:00:14.668
Tap Marketing.

00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:15.708
Step one:

00:00:15.844 --> 00:00:16.988
choose who receives it.

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:23.037
All customers, Recent customers, Haven't been back, Loyal customers, New customers,

00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:23.948
Card members,

00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:25.308
or Your contact list.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.028
Each group shows how many customers it has.

00:00:28.711 --> 00:00:29.483
Step two:

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:30.843
the email content.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.963
The quickest way is to tap one of the ready-made templates.

00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:37.883
The subject line and the message fill in for you, and you can change anything.

00:00:38.256 --> 00:00:41.723
Tap Customer name, so the email greets each person by name.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.083
You can add a picture too.

00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:44.536
Step three:

00:00:44.612 --> 00:00:46.410
switch on Add an offer coupon,

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.674
and a gold coupon stands out in the middle of the email,

00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:52.296
for example twenty percent off every service.

00:00:52.564 --> 00:00:56.616
Below that, choose the Booking button, so customers can book with one tap.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.294
Before you send, tap Preview email,

00:00:59.244 --> 00:01:02.873
to see the email exactly as it looks on your customer's phone.

00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:06.233
You can also send a test to your own email, free of charge.

00:01:06.861 --> 00:01:12.252
Finally, choose Send now, or Schedule, to send it on the day and time you want.

00:01:12.551 --> 00:01:15.132
Each email sent costs one Vara point.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.932
You can earn more points by checking in, or by inviting other salons to VaraaAi.

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:21.852
Tap Send, and you're done.

00:01:22.271 --> 00:01:26.012
In the Campaigns tab, you can follow how many people opened and clicked.

00:01:26.269 --> 00:01:27.532
Now take the quiz below.
